    "description": "The all-in-one, top booking, payments and marketing solution for teams and solopreneurs across the US. The GlossGenius booking app is trusted by tens of thousands of business owners for: \r\n \r\n\u2022  Easy-to-use appointment scheduler and calendar planner \r\n\u2022  Automated appointment scheduling \r\n\u2022  Gorgeous customizable websites\r\n\u2022  Client management tools \r\n\u2022  Powerful marketing \r\n\u2022  Same-business-day payment transfers\r\n\u2022  Fast and stunning chip card readers \r\n\u2022  Customizable client communication \r\nAnd more! \r\n\r\nYour clients' experience begins the moment they book with you, which is why we've designed the most stunning customizable booking site that you can set up in minutes. \r\n\r\nGlossGenius is the easiest, most intuitive platform for salon and studio professionals. This includes beauty experts, hair stylists, skincare professionals, wax & brow artists, cosmetologists, estheticians, fitness instructors, or any pro looking for easy booking with a beautiful spin.\r\n\r\nWHY GLOSSGENIUS? \r\n \r\nTHE EASIEST WAY TO GET BOOKED & PAID \r\nCustomers can book online through your website, get confirmations, reminders, thank you\u2019s and personalized birthday notes! Clients can also book appointments through Instagram and Facebook. Checking out and rebooking clients will be easier than ever with our fast card readers and rebooking messages. \r\n \r\nA STUNNING NEW WEBSITE\r\nGet a new custom personal website in minutes - tailored with your branding, pricing, hours, and portfolio of work. Your site will not look the same as anyone else's.\r\n \r\nMORE MONEY IN THE BANK\r\nTake payments immediately with your mobile device through our built-in payment processing or order one of our secure card readers. Earn more money with the industry\u2019s lowest processing rate of 2.6% flat, no hidden fees and free same-business-day transfers.   \r\n \r\nUNLIMITED TEAM MEMBERS INCLUDED \r\nAs you grow your team we want to celebrate you for it - not charge you! Manage your business, staff and peace-of-mind in one place, for one simple, flat price. Control everything with powerful permissions and settings. \r\n \r\nBETTER EXPOSURE TO GROW YOUR CLIENTELE\r\nWe have built-in marketing tools so you can welcome back more customers, and find creative ways to get new ones too - using SEO, email and SMS messages. We also have integrations with Instagram, Facebook, and Yelp.\r\n \r\nSTUNNING CARD READERS. NO TRAINING.\r\nWe've got the easiest-to-use card readers available in many patterns. Process anything, anytime and anywhere.\r\n \r\nINCREDIBLE CUSTOMER SUPPORT\r\nWe treat your business like it\u2019s our own. We\u2019re the only platform to offer quick customer support through text, phone and email.\r\n \r\nPERSONAL HELP TRANSFERRING DATA\r\nWant to switch over from Vagaro, StyleSeat, Square, Schedulicity, Mindbody or another salon software but worried about losing your data? Worry no more -- we will personally copy over appointments, formula notes, etc. \r\n\r\nWHAT OUR CUSTOMERS ARE SAYING\r\n\r\n\u201cNothing like sending these mass texts through glossgenius and having an appointment filled in less than 10 minutes. Working smarter not harder\u201d - Skyler S \r\n \r\n\u201cObsessed with @glossgenius. This is a game changer for the industry, acts as your own personal assistant! I thought switching over was bold but it was so easy, they transferred all of my data from Square.\u201d - The Wildflower Collective\r\n \r\n\u201cGlossGenius is one of my guests\u2019 favorite experiences. It makes booking so much easier for them\u201d - Kristina K\r\n \r\n\u201cThe best user interface for salons right now. I have been in the industry for 10 years and this is literally the best.\u201d - Sharon O\r\n\r\n\u201cMoving over from Vagaro was seamless and faster than I even thought. Genius is an understatement\u201d - Kathy R",
